'''Melon''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made out of watermelon skin, hence the name. The guard is green, and the handle is solid black. 

== Trivia ==
* Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/311701292/MelonKnife texture] was designed by [[ArcticMage]], and was uploaded to Roblox on October 21, 2015.

